# Coding pipeline (playbook workflow): per-story worktrees, the generated role docs
# (copies of private playbook templates; regenerate per clone with sync-role-docs) and
# repo-local model config never enter git. Handoffs are tracked, but their debug
# artifacts are not.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/agents/
.env
docs/handoffs/**/*.prompt.txt
docs/handoffs/**/*.usage.json
docs/handoffs/**/*-sidecar*.md
docs/handoffs/**/*-result-r*.md
docs/handoffs/**/screenshots/
docs/handoffs/**/*-report.html
